&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27.4pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-27.4pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:14pt;font-size:14pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAmountsOfNotesAndAccountsReceivableTradeAndContractAssetsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAmountOfContractLiabilitiesTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:27.4pt;text-indent:-27.4pt;line-height:14pt;"&gt;※２　その他のうち、契約負債の金額は、以下のとおりであります。 &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:27pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:452pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
